---------- Recipe via Meal-Master (tm) v8.02

      Title: Biscuits
 Categories: Breads
      Yield: 12 Servings

      2 c  Flour
      1 T  Baking powder
      1 t  Salt

------------------------------FOR BRUSHING------------------------------
      2 T  Butter, melted

  Mix, cut out and bake at 450 F for 12 minutes.
  Brush with the butter.

-----
